--------ANONYMOUS CLASS------------
1) Create a interface.
2) Create an object of interface directly in Main class.
3) Give defination to methods.

There are some predefined interfaces in java.util.function package in JAVA, for example : Consumer,BiConsumer,Predicates,BiPRedicate,Fuction,BiFuntion
--------------LAMBDA EXPRESSIONS---------------
1) Create an object of interface.
2) Use (),{},-> for creating Lambda expressions.

-------------OPIMIZED LAMBDA EXPRESSION---------
When your function in function interface is of one line than we dont even need curly-brackets { }
